axionis-theme-manager (0.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix invisible popover contents in GTK 3 theme preview pickers.
  * Size and populate chooser grids before the first popup.
  * Add an Xvfb GUI regression test for usable popover dimensions.
  * Match Cinnamon theme precedence, GTK 3.x discovery and hidden-theme filtering.

